sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Panel
    participant A as exec-fn cc_client
    participant S as server.mjs
    participant K as Agent SDK run
    P->>A: POST /api/cc/query
    A->>S: POST /query
    alt slot taken
        S-->>A: 429 busy
        A->>A: wait up to CC_BUSY_WAIT, retry
    else free
        S->>K: query() resume = .cc-session
        K-->>S: session, text, tool, tool_result frames
        S-->>A: SSE frames
        A-->>P: SSE relayed
    end
    Note over S,K: a hangup does NOT abort. Frames to a dead socket are dropped, transcript keeps every word
    P->>A: POST /api/cc/interrupt
    A->>S: POST /interrupt
    S->>K: abort controller
    K-->>S: unwinds, slot frees
    S-->>A: error frame: run cancelled or timed out (a 10 min idle abort ends the same way)
